# Dance classes new times and dates

Tuesday nights are back!! Yes!! Baby will be strapped on Nathaniel's back and there will be a brand spanking new dance to get you all excited, sweating and laughing! Super excited to have Tuesday nights back at the new time of 6.30pm. There will be live drumming and of course the opportunity to perform monthly at our regular Saturplay event in Palmwoods. These classes are held at the Palmwoods Memorial Hall and are for all levels of fitness and will include a stretch, warm up, traditional West African dance routine and promise you an awesome Tuesday night.. what else did you have planned for a Tuesday night?...Nothing?! Great, see you on Tuesday then :) 5 week course $75/casual $15 (Bookings essential) Tuesdays @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall African dancing open class 6.30-7.30pm A 5 week course on Saturdays is also being offered from July 18th. This is bookings essential and is not open to casual dancers. Classes will be held at the Palmwoods Girl Guides Hut on Saturday mornings at 9am. The cost is $75 for the 5 weeks and the course must be paid in full by Wednesday July 15th. 5 week course $75 (must be paid in full by Wednesday July 15th) Saturdays @ Palmwoods Girl Guides Hut African dancing for beginners 9am
